          {
            "id": "article_deck",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "在一段安静的岸边，练习把目光放慢。\n不急着靠近，也不急着给这一刻下结论。",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 412,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 84,
            "fontSize": 19,
            "color": "#60706F",
            "lineHeight": 32,
            "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
            "wrap": true,
            "role": "introduction"
          },
          {
            "id": "article_byline",
            "type": "label",
            "text": "岸线编辑部  /  自然观察习作  /  约 3 分钟",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 524,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 30,
            "fontSize": 13,
            "color": "#60706F",
            "lineHeight": 19,
            "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
            "role": "byline"
          },
          {
            "id": "article_body_rule",
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "stack",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 578,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 1,
            "fill": "#C5CEC6",
            "children": [],
            "role": "separator"
          },
          {
            "id": "body_heading_1",
            "type": "label",
            "text": "慢一点，才看得见",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 618,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 46,
            "fontSize": 28,
            "color": "#1F353E",
            "lineHeight": 40,
            "fontFamily": "Songti SC",
            "fontWeight": 600,
            "role": "section-heading"
          },
          {
            "id": "body_paragraph_1",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "刚停下脚步时，眼前只有一片水。等视线适应了岸边的层次，细枝、倒影与那些轻轻摇动的草，才逐渐从背景里显出来。\n\n那抹蓝色停在低处的枝条上。它没有占据很大的空间，却让整幅画面有了一个安静的重心。我们站在原处，用眼睛沿着枝条的方向看过去，没有再向前。",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 692,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 180,
            "fontSize": 18,
            "color": "#1F353E",
            "lineHeight": 32,
            "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
            "wrap": true,
            "role": "long-content"
          },
          {
            "id": "body_heading_2",
            "type": "label",
            "text": "给观察留一点余地",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 906,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 46,
            "fontSize": 28,
            "color": "#1F353E",
            "lineHeight": 40,
            "fontFamily": "Songti SC",
            "fontWeight": 600,
            "role": "section-heading"
          },
          {
            "id": "body_paragraph_2",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "一次短暂的相遇，不需要被写成完整的故事。记下当时看见的颜色、姿态与距离，也记下自己没有看清的部分。留白并不是遗漏，而是对现场的一种尊重。\n\n离开时，水面已经换了另一种光。回头再看，枝条空了，沿岸的声音却比来时更清楚。",
            "x": 360,
            "y": 980,
            "w": 620,
            "h": 224,
            "fontSize": 18,
            "color": "#1F353E",
            "lineHeight": 32,
            "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
            "wrap": true,
            "role": "long-content"
          },
